{"id":"vod_sn_36729","vodId":"36729","provider":"sn","providerName":"索尼资源","type":2,"name":"头文字D第一季","name_cn":"头文字D第一季","date":"1998-01-01","year":"1998","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://snzypic.vip/upload/vod/20230911-1/ebde296ed1e3a656ccb137ac61efd0d9.jpg"},"summary":"藤原豆腐店的日常业务是，要在每天早晨把新鲜的豆腐送到各家各户，这个任务自然不是由懒惰的老板来做，而是落到了他的儿子——还是高中生的藤原拓海（三木真一郎 配音）身上。驾驶着老爸的旧款车AE86行驶于秋明山上的拓海日积月累练就了一手好车技，不管刮风还是下雨，都能做到不让水杯里的水撒出来不让豆腐变形，且速度极快。于是乎，“秋名山车神”的名号不胫而走，慢慢的吸引了各路赛车高手，想要和拓海一较高下。这其中包括了正式赛车队的天才赛车手高桥启介（关智一 配音）、拥有豪华跑车的中里毅（桧山修之 配音）等人。而拓海只是淡定的接受挑战，展示高超的车技……　　本片改编自漫画家重野秀一的同名漫画，可谓飙车题材中的NO.1，自1995年开始连载，还有同名电影版。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-11 15:45:38","playable":true,"episodeCount":26,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"snm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/SiBvbQcVJt1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/B4kfbggejv1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/6cHMGabuzb1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/qzJsr4899L1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/qLFKY0c3At1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/nYCQ6mGNAM1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/K3x32pA3sA1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/vTJYGGdWW21/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/XKAisHbDFp1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/ZbiJicrTSw1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/YRh8McDYpe1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/JVDfrquGFv1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/1YhZugrrDQ1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第14集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/yzyW3